          "type": "text",
          "title": "Turn a 4 × 4 Grid into a Place",
          "body": "The underlying route began as a regular 4 × 4 structure. Curved connections and a scenic island silhouette turn that logic into a world map. Fog clears in a cross-shaped pattern as landmarks unlock, revealing nearby possibilities without exposing the whole run at once.",
